{"seq":2,"slug":"stakeholder-capitalism-institutions","title":"博士 组织与战略前沿 — 利益相关者资本主义与制度理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/management/organizational-frontiers/sustainable-management/stakeholder-capitalism-institutions","wordCount":3595,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士-组织与战略前沿-利益相关者资本主义与制度理论\">博士 组织与战略前沿 — 利益相关者资本主义与制度理论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>当企业的目的不再被定义为&quot;股东利益最大化&quot;时，整个管理学的分析框架都需要重新校准。利益相关者理论与制度理论的交汇构成了可持续管理研究的理论基石——前者回答&quot;企业应当为谁创造价值&quot;，后者解释&quot;为什么企业会（或不会）真正践行可持续承诺&quot;。本文从 Freeman 的利益相关者理论出发，梳理工具性与规范性两条理论路径，深入探讨股东至上与利益相关者资本主义的根本分歧，继而引入制度理论分析可持续性在组织场域中的扩散机制，最后考察脱耦、制度复杂性与制度创业等前沿概念如何解释企业在可持续转型中的真实行为。</p>\n<p>核心概念速览：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>利益相关者理论（Stakeholder Theory）</strong>：企业应当考虑所有受其活动影响或能影响其活动的群体的利益</li>\n<li><strong>股东至上（Shareholder Primacy）</strong>：企业的首要义务是最大化股东财富（Friedman, 1970）</li>\n<li><strong>制度同构（Institutional Isomorphism）</strong>：组织在制度压力下趋于相似的过程（DiMaggio &amp; Powell, 1983）</li>\n<li><strong>组织合法性（Organizational Legitimacy）</strong>：组织行为被社会系统视为适当、正当的感知（Suchman, 1995）</li>\n<li><strong>脱耦（Decoupling）</strong>：组织正式结构与实际运作之间的系统性偏离</li>\n<li><strong>制度创业（Institutional Entrepreneurship）</strong>：行动者主动创造、改变或颠覆制度安排的过程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-freeman-的利益相关者理论及其演进\">一、Freeman 的利益相关者理论及其演进</h3><p>R. Edward Freeman 在 1984 年出版的 <em>Strategic Management: A Stakeholder Approach</em> 中首次系统提出了利益相关者理论。其核心命题是：企业管理者的任务不是为单一股东群体服务，而是在多个利益相关者群体之间创造和分配价值。</p>\n<p>Freeman 将利益相关者定义为&quot;任何能够影响组织目标实现或被组织目标实现所影响的个人或群体&quot;。这一宽泛定义涵盖了股东、员工、客户、供应商、社区、政府乃至自然环境。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F[企业] --- S1[股东]&#10;    F --- S2[员工]&#10;    F --- S3[客户]&#10;    F --- S4[供应商]&#10;    F --- S5[社区]&#10;    F --- S6[政府与监管者]&#10;    F --- S7[债权人]&#10;    F --- S8[自然环境]\">graph TD\n    F[企业] --- S1[股东]\n    F --- S2[员工]\n    F --- S3[客户]\n    F --- S4[供应商]\n    F --- S5[社区]\n    F --- S6[政府与监管者]\n    F --- S7[债权人]\n    F --- S8[自然环境]</pre><p>该理论经历了三个演进阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段（1984-1995）：描述性与战略性阶段。</strong> Freeman 最初将利益相关者管理定位为一种战略工具——企业关注利益相关者是因为这样做有助于实现更好的财务绩效。这一时期的核心问题是&quot;谁是利益相关者&quot;以及&quot;如何管理利益相关者关系&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>第二阶段（1995-2010）：规范性与伦理转向。</strong> Donaldson &amp; Preston（1995）在 <em>Academy of Management Review</em> 上的经典论文将利益相关者理论区分为三个层面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>代表性论证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>描述性（Descriptive）</td>\n<td>企业实际上是否关注利益相关者？</td>\n<td>经验观察：大多数成功企业确实管理多方关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具性（Instrumental）</td>\n<td>关注利益相关者是否带来更好的财务绩效？</td>\n<td>实证检验：利益相关者管理 → 信任 → 降低交易成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规范性（Normative）</td>\n<td>企业是否应当关注利益相关者？</td>\n<td>伦理论证：所有利益相关者都具有内在价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Donaldson &amp; Preston 的关键贡献在于指出规范性层面是理论的核心——利益相关者理论不仅仅是一种工具，而是一种关于企业本质的伦理立场。</p>\n<p><strong>第三阶段（2010 至今）：价值创造与整合阶段。</strong> Freeman 及其合作者（Freeman, Harrison, Wicks, Parmar &amp; de Colle, 2010）在 <em>Stakeholder Theory: The State of the Art</em> 中提出了&quot;价值创造与交换&quot;（value creation and trade）框架，强调利益相关者之间的利益并非零和博弈，优秀的管理可以创造多方共赢。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-股东至上-vs-利益相关者资本主义\">二、股东至上 vs 利益相关者资本主义</h3><p>Milton Friedman 在 1970 年《纽约时报》上发表的 <em>The Social Responsibility of Business is to Increase its Profits</em> 是股东至上学说的经典表述。其核心论证可以形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{a \\in A} \\; \\Pi(a) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad a \\in \\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pi(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为利润函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为管理者的行动空间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为法律约束集。Friedman 认为企业的唯一社会责任就是在法律和基本伦理规范内最大化利润，任何超出此范围的&quot;社会责任&quot;行为都是管理者滥用股东委托的资源。</p>\n<p>利益相关者资本主义对此提出了根本性反驳。其优化问题可以表述为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>U</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{a \\in A} \\; V(a) = \\sum_{k=1}^{K} w_k \\cdot U_k(a) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad U_k(a) \\geq \\bar{U}_k \\; \\forall k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span cl